      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Wardha</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Executing a seamless bike transport from Wardha to Pune requires meticulous preparation of administrative documentation. The journey spans approximately 450 kilometers, traversing varied terrains that demand strict adherence to regulatory standards and logistical protocols. To ensure your two-wheeler arrives safely and promptly, you must compile a specific set of legal and operational documents.</p>
<p>These papers act as the foundation for the entire logistics chain, facilitating smooth handovers at the warehouse in Wardha and ensuring clear title transfer upon delivery in Pune. Failing to provide complete documentation can result in significant delays, refusal of pickup, or complications during the final unloading process. Therefore, accuracy and completeness are paramount.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The core of your documentation package begins with the vehicle’s legal identity.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>You must provide a self-attested photocopy of the Registration Certificate (RC).</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The self-attestation is a critical legal step that validates the authenticity of the document without requiring a notary, thereby saving time and cost.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Simultaneously, you must present a current Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate.</span></li></ul>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">While not always mandatory for interstate transport in every jurisdiction, many professional logistics providers require it to verify that the vehicle is roadworthy and compliant with environmental standards.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Additionally, a valid insurance certificate must be included.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This document proves that the vehicle is covered against third-party liabilities and accidental damage, satisfying the carrier’s risk management requirements before they accept the consignment.</span></li></ul>

<p>Beyond vehicle-specific documents, the logistics provider will issue an IBA-approved consignment bilty. This is the official commercial document that records the details of the shipment, including the sender’s and receiver’s addresses, the vehicle’s make and model, and the estimated delivery timeline.</p>
<p>It serves as the contract between you and the transporter, outlining the terms of service and liability. You must review this document carefully before signing, ensuring all details match the physical asset.</p>

