      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Pre-Loading Inspection, Odometer Logging &amp; Photographic Audit for Bike Transport from Wardha</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When transporting a two‑wheeler or motorcycle, a thorough pre‑loading audit protects both the vehicle and the logistics chain. The process begins with a 360‑degree digital condition audit that captures high‑resolution images and sensor data of the bike’s exterior, frame, and mechanical components. Next, battery terminals are inspected for corrosion and tightened to manufacturer torque specifications.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Fuel management is handled by filling the tank to a one‑quarter level, ensuring consistent weight distribution during transit and preventing fuel spillage.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Finally, FASTag management is verified to avoid any toll‑related delays on the route.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By following these steps, packers and movers in Wardha, Pune, and across India can guarantee a smooth, safe relocation for your prized motorcycle.</span></li></ul>

